cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this SemRepair research artifact, please cite the software."
title: "SemRepair: Semantic Type-and-Effect Compilation for Embodied AI"
version: "0.3.0-rc2"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "lindicaphxag-tech"
repository-code: "https://github.com/lindicaphxag-tech/Isaac-GR00T"
keywords:
  - embodied AI
  - robotics
  - semantic types
  - program synthesis
  - runtime verification
abstract: >-
  SemRepair infers hidden physical semantics at embodied-learning software
  boundaries, type-checks producer-consumer composition, synthesizes bounded
  repairs for forgeable mismatches, binds runtime authority to independently
  verified executable identities, and uses interaction evidence to prevent
  unsafe partial activation of compensating repair sets.
